Author: Hunter J. Melton [aut, cre],
    Chinmay Vaidya [aut]
Maintainer: Hunter J. Melton <Hunter.J.Melton@dartmouth.edu>
Description: Spatial Immune Receptor Analysis and Processing. How sweet is
    that? A native R interface to the 'rad' demultiplexer through 'rrad', plus
    optional compatibility wrappers for the 'rad' command-line tool and a
    consolidated toolkit for long-read spatial immune receptor sequencing:
    AIRR-style rearrangement tables with spatial IDs and coordinates,
    Visium HD barcode mapping, pRESTO/IgBLAST shell pipeline generation,
    clonal summaries, tree plotting, int64-packed DNA
    primitives, and PAF parsing utilities.
